WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.350
Queen's Blade.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.520
Everything is in accordance with the Queen's will.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:09.180
The warriors are still unaware of the time, place, or opponent of their next battle.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:14.910
Fate is said to be ironic; it bewilders the hearts and minds of the warriors.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:24.000
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.630
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:44.060
Just as I can see no end to this sky,

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.980
I inherit the will and strength that will exist forever.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:57.320
With each person carrying different feelings in their heart,

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:05.040
When the time comes, they will fulfill their promise with that special someone.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:09.460
In order to become

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:14.630
the chosen ruler of this world,

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:18.720
I will shake off any pain I feel.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:25.980
The sky will not fall, the sea will not drought, and the earth will not split.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:32.020
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:39.030
No one shall stop me on my path.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.210
So we meet again, Nowa.

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.760
Yeah. Good afternoon.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.660
I was wondering who it could be, and it turned out to be you...

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.300
Ms. Combat Instructor.

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:05.220
So you know each other after all, Instructor.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.600
Wild elf, Echidna.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.440
Also known as the Veteran Mercenary.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.690
We went through a great number of deadly encounters together.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.720
An old story.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:14.960
At any rate...

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:19.240
A showdown between masters and students, doesn't the Queen have excellent taste?

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.590
This seems to be turning into an amusing battle.

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:25.050
Let us brace ourselves, Nowa.

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:26.850
Yes, Instructor!

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:30.080
I'll do my best so I won't be in your way!

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.130
You're wide open!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:46.310
The battle has already begun.

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.170
You lack awareness of your surroundings.

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:49.390
Nowa, 20 points.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:50.850
I-I'm sorry.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:04.530
I'm saved.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:12.380
Wha-

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:25.890
Thank you, Instructor.

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:29.330
Instructor?

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:30.430
Wear these.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:32.730
Hurry.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:35.410
Okay, if Instructor says so.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.480
You two are amusing.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:41.290
I'll get jealous if you become any more intimate.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.700
You're so different from us.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.620
I'd like such an obedient pupil myself.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:52.150
Nowa, instead of being that thousand year virgin's pupil,

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.460
why don't you pair with me?

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.250
I might teach you a few things.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.710
Even at night, I'll train you in some very special ways...

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:00.480
Even at night, I'll train you in some very special ways...

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:01.150
Even at night, I'll train you in some very special ways...

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:01.550
Even at night, I'll train you in some very special ways...

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.860
You'll like my special training.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.820
It's quite different from Ms. Instructor's...

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:11.080
Much more pleasurable...

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.640
Too much idle chatter!

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.940
Echidna! 20 points!

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.890
Just kidding.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.750
That's why you're too stiff!

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:35.210
I did it!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.450
I wonder what's going on?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.110
Something's coming.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.960
You're 500 years too early to try eating me.

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:10.910
Now I'm all wet, how disgusting.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.580
Are you alright, Kirutan?

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:15.520
Let's take a one hour break.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.040
I'm changing locations.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.420
A magnificent opponent.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.140
Nothing can break her invincible spirit.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:27.560
Wild elf, Echidna...

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:31.710
She hasn't changed since she was staying in our forest.

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:32.950
That unwavering strength.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.470
Hey, hey! What's wrong?

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:45.800
Isn't there anyone here who can get me serious?

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:48.070
Rushing into battle shows inexperience.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.070
65 points.

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:54.330
What is it, Ms. Combat Instructor?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.410
Are you here to preach to me?

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.490
No, not to preach...

00:05:58.490 --> 00:05:59.250
but to guide you.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:02.380
100 points for sophism, eh?

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:27.070
See you.

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:32.480
After that, she disappeared from our forest.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:38.590
I never expected to cross swords with Echidna again in such a way.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:40.710
So she's that strong.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.650
Instructor, Nowa will try her best, too!

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:46.110
So we'll win for sure, right?

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.380
You're right.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.530
Ah, but Instructor...

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:51.890
I wonder why that Irma person isn't fighting.

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:54.170
I don't know the details,

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:55.930
but it's convenient for us.

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.060
Echidna and Irma...

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:01.160
If those two worked together, our chances of success would be slim.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:01.690
However,

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:05.680
if we are together, we can certainly defeat them one at a time.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:07.940
Do not fall behind, my pupil!

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.180
Okay!

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:24.660
Here you go! With this, you are now a servant of the great Amara Kingdom.

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:26.920
Next, please!

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:32.000
Congratulations! You're the 100th servant!

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:32.550
Here!

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.690
Next in line, please!

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:36.530
101st servant!

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:39.560
We don't have time to be doing something like this.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.650
Please take good care of it, okay?

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.680
As I thought, Echidna is strong.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:47.900
Huh?

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:50.820
She's wearing something...

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.970
Those are leaves, aren't they?

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:54.690
Why?

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:05.550
Well, then...

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.160
Shall we continue?

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.440
Tornado Strike!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.260
A traitor like her...

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:46.830
Damn it!

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:48.000
This is...

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.700
Just as I thought...

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:51.340
that fits you quite well.

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:55.750
Instructor!

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.180
Don't worry about me!

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.290
Fight, Nowa!

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:00.310
Y-Yes!

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:05.570
At last, it's just the two of us.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.070
Shall we continue with our private lesson?

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:10.170
Let's go, Ru!

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:19.200
Oh? You're doing quite well, eh?

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:24.220
Lesson one:

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:27.460
If you do nothing but attack, your defense will become weak.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:36.330
Attacking is the greatest defense.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:40.550
However, if you do nothing but attack, you wont be able to protect yourself.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.260
Remember that well.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:43.340
Yes!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.150
Irma...

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.440
You're precious to me; my one and only apprentice.

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.570
You aren't my master anymore.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:01.910
Lesson two:

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:03.630
This is pretty obvious, though...

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:07.330
People have the strength to withstand attacks from above. However...

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:12.840
you have to watch out for things like this.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.990
Lesson three:

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.420
What are you going to do now?

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.320
Nowa!

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:20.850
This stickiness...

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.020
Kirutan!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.110
That was a nice attack.

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:41.490
I'm all fired up now!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.530
Ouch!

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:56.020
Well then, what should I teach you next?

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:58.840
Hurricane Fury!{illustrated here: http://img1.gelbooru.com//images/456/eaca9d9ab01c51bc61cf2610347d151e2913e8e0.jpg}

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:04.450
Take this!

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.060
I am Nowa's instructor.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.730
Let us battle, Echidna.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.150
Now we're talking.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.200
Instructor...

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.330
Isn't it about time we finished what we started so long ago?

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:34.390
That's fine with me.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.680
Your seamless transition from defense to offense is admirable.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.930
However, you were a bit negligent at the end.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.020
85 points!

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:53.600
Your sermon back then was so damn annoying.

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:56.440
It wasn't a sermon. It was guidance!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.030
Who do you think you are?

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.880
This match is over.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.420
I wonder...

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.550
Nowa!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:30.240
Fight, Instructor! I'll be fine!

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:37.230
Well, then.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:39.200
What will you do?

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.150
I admit defeat.

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:47.320
Instructor.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.500
Victors: Echidna and Irma.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:04.010
Thanks.

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:06.130
It isn't as if...

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:07.820
this was for your sake.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:10.140
If you had lost, I would have lost, too.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.820
You really aren't honest with yourself, eh?

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:16.040
You just can't help but love me, can you?

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.060
Who would!?

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:20.100
I just couldn't afford to lose.

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:24.030
You're still aiming for the Queen's head?

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:31.330
As I knew, the bonds between teacher and student can't compare to the bond between siblings, after all.

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:32.580
Shut up!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.830
This has nothing to do with you.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:39.880
Don't push yourself too hard...

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:45.340
I'm sorry, Instructor...

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.510
It's all my fault.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.720
It's because I got in your way...

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.810
I'm sorry.

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.140
My disciple, Nowa.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:58.940
Look inside your heart once more to find the answer.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.080
What is truly important to you?

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.800
Aside from winning Queen's Blade...

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:08.660
aren't there other ways of protecting our forest?

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.990
Instructor...

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:13.490
After reaching this city, I think I finally understood it, as well.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.160
Let's go home, Nowa.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.080
Yes!

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:28.050
Today's Queen's Blade was amazing.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.800
I want to fight soon, too!

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:34.930
Ah, it's all worn out.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.560
Um, how is it?

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.440
You've worn it down considerably, eh?

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.240
I kept thinking I should have you look at it sooner or later, but...

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.630
It can't even be compared to last time...

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:51.340
You've made good use of it.

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:54.890
It shows how much stronger you've become, Leina-san.

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:57.200
Is that so?

00:14:58.180 --> 00:15:00.540
Let's repair this rarity at once.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:06.670
I'll sell, sell, and sell some more!

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:09.490
The quadrennial Queen's Blade!

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:12.310
I can't let this chance pass me by!

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:15.120
I'll certainly increase my profit five-fold!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.480
You two ladies there!

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.180
What do you think? This sword's shine is unmatched...

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:22.030
But this axe is also excellent!

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:24.450
Look, look! Pick them up and look for yourself!

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:25.140
Ymir-cha-

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.780
Ymir-san.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.280
Oh, it's just you.

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.770
Excuse me, I was wondering if you could let us borrow your furnace?

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:36.080
I would like Cattleya to repair my sword.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.970
It's in the back, just go use it.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:41.010
I'm busy right now!

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:43.660
Act now, and I'll throw in this shield!

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:44.880
E-Excuse me...

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:48.090
Are you perhaps the Weaponsmith, Cattleya?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.840
Yes, I am, however...

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:53.160
Eh? Really? Amazing!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.760
We never thought we'd meet you in a place like this!

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:02.000
Isn't there a store in Gainos that sells your weapons?

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.120
Unfortunately not...

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:05.980
What a shame.

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:09.030
I'm very sorry...

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:12.710
However, if you ever find yourself in Bosk, feel free to stop by.

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:14.440
We'll definitely come by!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:18.140
Cattleya's swords are so easy to use. I love them!

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:19.580
Right?

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:20.830
Thank you very much.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.240
Hey, you guys!

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:28.170
You're in my fucking way! Don't interfere with my business!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:34.250
She didn't have to get so angry...

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:36.640
It just shows how much pride she takes in her work.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.930
Steel Mountain's current goods are magnificent...

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.700
because they have been passed down from generation to generation.

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:49.520
It's nice to be able to take pride in things like that.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.320
My husband Owen is the same way.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:56.620
What kind of person is Owen?

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:59.190
He is a graceful and strong man.

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:01.870
Just like this sword.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.090
He brought out the maximum potential of the alchemist's steel.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:13.550
He always thought about the people who would use his swords as he was forging them.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:19.920
With an iron will, and with such strength, I wish
to protect his tradition by continuing to follow it.

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:26.770
But the truth is that I want to continue protecting my family, Rana and Owen.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:35.530
Attaining victory by protecting.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.700
Thank you very much, Leina-san.

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:43.000
If you hadn't given me my sword at that time...

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.370
I wouldn't have attained the determination I needed...

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:48.840
and would have continued waiting for my husband.

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:51.000
But nothing would have changed like that.

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.850
If I participate in Queen's Blade...

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:57.090
Owen may watch me from somewhere.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.370
I wish to regain...

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:03.930
our family bonds.

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:11.300
I wish to regain...

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:12.770
our family bonds.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:19.530
I wish to protect this tradition by continuing to follow it.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:21.760
Mother...

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.000
I'll become stronger, too.

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.270
With this sword you have entrusted me with...

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:36.880
It's here! It's Onee-chan's turn!

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:55.920
I was wondering who it could be, and it turned out to be you.

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:02.990
Ymir?

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:04.750
That's right.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:11.000
I'll do my best to make the name of Steel Mountain known throughout the continent via Queen's Blade!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.540
And I'll start by defeating you!

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:18.050
I won't lose either.

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:36.690
Mommy.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.290
Leina will win, right?

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:41.530
She has Daddy's sword with her.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.380
I wonder.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:50.450
Ymir's battle axe and Daddy's sword are both magnificent weapons.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.750
It is impossible to tell which one will surpass the other.

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:02.430
Melona is nowhere to be found.

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:04.930
Menace can't be relied upon anymore, either.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:10.890
I am now the only one left to follow Master's commands.

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:15.520
Even if it has come to me participating in Queen's Blade alone...

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:20.570
I will crush anyone in my way.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.450
Take me with you.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:31.200
Rana!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:33.650
I want to be with Mommy.

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:35.060
Besides,

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:38.960
I want Daddy to see us fighting together.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:44.760
Alright. Let's fight together.

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:06.240
The target of my next meal seems to contain some rather delicious life energy.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.910
I can't believe you brought your child along.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:12.160
Are you trying to make a fool out of me?

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:15.330
Not at all. This child is also a splendid warrior.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.830
I just can't agree with something like this.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.420
If that is the case, Airi...

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.760
you are declaring your loss.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.300
What did you say?

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:31.850
Queen Aldra...

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:34.490
This match shall be held in the presence of the Queen.

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:35.790
Feel honored.

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:43.280
Setora?

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:44.530
Setora?

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:48.530
Strange, he left me again and went off somewhere by himself.

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:54.160
I'm always doing my best to revive my great kingdom!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:58.000
Come now, bow down before the great Kingdom of Amara!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.540
Swamp Witch.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.170
An eerie existence.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.060
Well, we're all girls of the underworld.

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:05.760
Majestic orders.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:07.590
Oh, Swamp Witch.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:08.930
Such erotic actions.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.600
We'll truly show our love for you.

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:11.390
Yes.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:13.720
The three of us will all serve you.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:14.470
Really?

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:15.350
Most likely.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:18.140
Girls, let's all do our jobs properly.

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:20.650
It's Menace, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:23.070
I'm the princess of the Amara Kingdom.

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:25.370
For as long as I please, I won't hold back

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:27.780
In making you bow to my great authority.

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:30.130
No matter how much time may pass,

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:32.550
I'm a flower that will never wither.

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:34.740
Well then, let me show you

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:37.750
The proof that I live up to my name.

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:42.500
The living scepter, Setra, is her companion.

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:49.970
They're an ancient combination, here they go!

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:53.100
I have a majestic body.

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:55.600
I'll get you with my fatal Royal Headbutt!

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:57.770
Pathetic traffic.

00:22:57.770 --> 00:22:59.900
And finally, Shining Pyramid.

00:22:59.900 --> 00:23:02.650
Then, you should pass away slowly

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:05.320
Bound with cursed bandages.

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:07.320
You'll feel a great history

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:10.200
In a dream you will never wake from.

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:16.700
Sorry to keep you waiting! It's Melona.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:18.720
As usual, she's deciding locations as she pleases.

00:23:18.720 --> 00:23:20.370
I wouldn't expect anything less from Her Evilness.

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:23.710
Aldra's right in front of me, but I can't lay a hand on her.

00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:26.170
And I really wanted to finish her off with a surprise attack.

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:28.930
Oh? Airi's big entrance!

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:32.900
A warrior with a child is doing it in front of the Queen.

00:23:32.900 --> 00:23:36.750
Leaving that aside, get me out of here, Airi!

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:40.340
Next time: Strategy! Royal Palace of Grief.

00:23:40.340 --> 00:23:43.190
Will you question your existence when faced with its meaning?
